<h2 id="custom-meta-key">Custom meta key</h2>
<p>You can swap <code>annotate</code> for another attribute name when you want a more domain-specific notation.</p>
<pre class="ox-highlight css-variables" style="background-color:var(--octc-syntax-background, #0d1117);color:var(--octc-syntax-foreground, #e6edf3)" tabindex="0" data-language="ts"><code class="language-ts" data-language="ts"><span class="line"><span style="color:var(--octc-syntax-token-function, #d2a8ff)">oxContent</span><span style="color:var(--octc-syntax-token-punctuation, #c9d1d9)">(</span><span style="color:var(--octc-syntax-token-punctuation, #c9d1d9)">{</span></span>
